# Frontend/Mobile App Integration Guide

This guide explains how to integrate Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) push notifications into your frontend/mobile application to receive notifications even when users are not logged in or the app is closed.

## 📋 Overview

Your backend automatically sends push notifications when:
- ✅ Tasks are created/updated/completed
- ✅ Projects are created/updated
- ✅ Chat messages are sent
- ✅ Any notification is created

**Key Feature:** Users can receive notifications even when **not logged in** - they just need to register their FCM token with their `ajiltniiId`.

