## 🔗 API Endpoints Reference

- **POST** `/fcm/register` - Register/update FCM token
- **GET** `/fcm/tokens?ajiltniiId=USER_ID` - Get user's tokens
- **PUT** `/fcm/deactivate` - Deactivate token
- **DELETE** `/fcm/token/:token` - Remove token

See [FCM_SETUP.md](./FCM_SETUP.md) for backend setup details.

